# examples/games/09_after_school, played: the title, into town, Aki at the
# cafe, the flyer by the east trees, Mika at the school gate -- asked to the
# festival, then asked about Sora, so she walks to the pond and the script
# waits for her -- and home, to the festival ending.
#
# The arrows walk, E talks, Enter goes on through a line (a first press shows
# all of it, a second goes on). See tests/e2e/script.h for the grammar.

# The title's panel appears for 0.25 s: the shot waits.
24 shot title
25 expect scene TitleScene
# The languages lang.tsv has, under the menu: Espanol, and back to English.
26 click 463 268
40 shot title_es
41 click 334 268
# New afternoon still has the focus.
43 tap KEY_ENTER
43 expect scene TownScene
60 shot town
# Up the street to the crossing, west to the cafe's path, and up it to Aki.
61 press KEY_UP
221 release KEY_UP
222 press KEY_LEFT
409 release KEY_LEFT
410 press KEY_UP
424 release KEY_UP
# Close enough to talk: "Talk" floats over her.
429 shot prompt
431 tap KEY_E
470 shot aki
# Aki's two lines: a press shows all of a line, the next goes on.
475 tap KEY_ENTER
480 tap KEY_ENTER
500 tap KEY_ENTER
505 tap KEY_ENTER
# Back to the street, east to its end, down past the pond, and the flyer.
521 press KEY_DOWN
535 release KEY_DOWN
536 press KEY_RIGHT
936 release KEY_RIGHT
937 press KEY_DOWN
1084 release KEY_DOWN
1085 press KEY_LEFT
1097 release KEY_LEFT
1110 shot flyer
# Back the way it came, to Mika at the school gate.
1111 press KEY_RIGHT
1123 release KEY_RIGHT
1124 press KEY_UP
1271 release KEY_UP
1272 press KEY_LEFT
1485 release KEY_LEFT
1491 tap KEY_E
1530 tap KEY_ENTER
1535 tap KEY_ENTER
1555 tap KEY_ENTER
1560 tap KEY_ENTER
1580 shot ask
# The festival, asked: the first choice, then her answer.
1581 tap KEY_ENTER
1610 tap KEY_ENTER
1615 tap KEY_ENTER
# Again: now the first choice is Sora, and she walks to the pond to show him.
1630 tap KEY_E
1670 tap KEY_ENTER
1675 tap KEY_ENTER
1700 tap KEY_ENTER
1740 tap KEY_ENTER
1745 tap KEY_ENTER
# The view goes with her, and the line after <<walk>> waits until she is there.
1850 shot walking
2040 shot pond
2045 tap KEY_ENTER
2050 tap KEY_ENTER
# Home, down the street, to the evening: Mika's line, and the festival.
2070 press KEY_DOWN
2260 release KEY_DOWN
2290 shot home
2295 tap KEY_ENTER
2300 expect scene EndScene
2360 shot ending
# Back to the title has the focus.
2361 tap KEY_ENTER
2363 expect scene TitleScene
2390 shot title_again
2391 end
